@StudyApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5031

### Get current AI settings (API keys are masked, never returned raw)
GET {{StudyApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ai/settings
Accept: application/json

### Update AI settings — BYOK + guardrails example
PUT {{StudyApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ai/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatProvider": "OpenAiCompatible",
  "chatBaseUrl": "https://api.openai.com",
  "chatModel": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "chatApiKey": "sk-your-key-here",
  "guardrails": "You are a study assistant. Only answer from the provided context. If the answer is not in the context, say so. Never help with cheating.",
  "systemPromptTemplate": "{guardrails}\n\nWorkspace context:\n{workspace_context}\n\nRetrieved context:\n{retrieved_context}",
  "embeddingProvider": "Ollama",
  "embeddingBaseUrl": "http://localhost:11434",
  "embeddingModel": "nomic-embed-text",
  "embeddingApiKey": null
}

### Set the workspace first-context (pinned into every chat in this workspace)
PUT {{StudyApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kubernetes",
  "description": "CKA exam prep — core Kubernetes concepts",
  "customInstructions": "Always explain with kubectl examples. Use CKA exam phrasing."
}

### Test the saved (or supplied) configuration — lists models and checks embedding dimensions
POST {{StudyApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ai/test
Content-Type: application/json

{}
